     * smallest value <i>k</i> such that:
     * <blockquote><pre>
     * (this.codePointAt(<i>k</i>) == searchChar) &amp;&amp; (<i>k</i> &gt;= start)
     * </pre></blockquote>
     * is true. In either case, if no such character occurs inm {@code cs}
     * at or after position {@code start}, then
     * {@code -1} is returned.
