     * </pre></blockquote>
     * is true. For other values of {@code searchChar}, it is the
     * largest value <i>k</i> such that:
     * <blockquote><pre>
     * (this.codePointAt(<i>k</i>) == searchChar) &amp;&amp; (<i>k</i> &lt;= start)
     * </pre></blockquote>
     * is true. In either case, if no such character occurs in {@code cs}
